Audit complete: **FAIL / NOT_LEGIT**.

The rebuilt proof is non-vacuous and all seven claims reach `#Top`, but `semantic.k` models Python string length incorrectly. For `["😀", "aa"]`, both Python implementations return `"aa"` while both fresh K definitions return `"😀"`.

Detailed findings: [REVIEW.md](/audit-output/REVIEW.md)  
Reproducible artifacts: [evidence](/audit-output/evidence/)
